OL,3,GNEWSADelivery driver who killed cyclist
OL,4,Ain daylight crash had time to react,   
OL,5,Asay police                             
OL,7,FA delivery driver who killed a cyclist 
OL,8,Fin a daylight crash on a road in West  
OL,9,FLothian had time to react, according to
OL,10,Fpolice evidence heard in court.        
OL,12,FStephen Wright's van collided with     
OL,13,FDaniel Corr's bike near West Calder,   
OL,14,Fthrowing him onto the bonnet and       
OL,15,Fwindscreen of his vehicle. The         
OL,16,F65-year-old died after sustaining blunt
OL,17,Fforce injury to his neck and chest.    
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
