OL,3,GNEWSADelivery driver who killed cyclist
OL,4,Ain daylight crash had time to react,   
OL,5,Asay police                             
OL,7,FWright, 61, admitted causing death by  
OL,8,Fdangerous driving when he appeared at  
OL,9,Fthe High Court in Edinburgh. He was    
OL,10,Fremanded in custody and will be        
OL,11,Fsentenced at a later date.             
OL,13,FThe family of Daniel Corr said they    
OL,14,Fwelcomed the early plea that spared    
OL,15,Fthem the "anguish" of a trial, but no  
OL,16,Fconviction or sentence would "come     
OL,17,Fclose to reflecting the pain of losing 
OL,18,Fhim."                                  
